// Article 3. Distributions.
#require "2-decisions.charter".
Use poll(usd) As payout
Fact paid Identified by person * usd
Power distribute Actor company Related to usd
  Holds when True
  Valid when payout-majority(usd) && usd <= cash.usd
  Creates (Foreach capital: paid(capital.person, MulDivRound(usd, capital.int, total-capital.int, Floor)))
        , cash(cash.usd - Sum(Foreach capital: MulDivRound(usd, capital.int, total-capital.int, Floor)))
  Terminates (Foreach person: payout-yes(person, usd))

Clause 3.1 Approved "c78d0281f24d8518057718d4fdb0a85c79ed409ca8e63b66db89238c2f9cb00f"
  Norm "The members may by ordinary decision distribute cash the company holds." => payout-vote, distribute
Clause 3.2 Approved "ac2a94b7251397c5dbf9262f73c4ed6c8c903a5e1b6b95b1fe71251c0120abbf"
  Norm "A distribution is divided among the members in proportion to their percentage interests. Each share is rounded down to the cent, and what is left over stays with the company." => distribute
.
